 "title": {
  "raw": "Jak pracuję"
 },
 "content": {
  "raw": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 40px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(56px, 6.7vw, 96px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 40px);padding-bottom:clamp(56px, 6.7vw, 96px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-okruszki\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-okruszki\"><a href=\"/\">Strona główna</a> › Jak pracuję</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-hero-tekst\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-hero-tekst\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">Jak pracuję</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Od ankiety do <em>gotowej</em> strony</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-wstep\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-wstep\">Wszystko ustalamy na piśmie. Rozmowa na Google Meet tylko wtedy, gdy wolisz porozmawiać.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"backgroundColor\":\"czern\",\"textColor\":\"krem\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"kroki\",\"className\":\"is-style-ciemna\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-ciemna has-krem-color has-czern-background-color has-text-color has-background\" id=\"kroki\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-naglowek-sekcji\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-naglowek-sekcji\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">Pięć kroków</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Każdy krok ma <em>termin</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"left\":\"28px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"200px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-krok\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-krok\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-cyfra\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-cyfra\">1</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ankieta, 5 minut</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pytania o Twoją firmę i klientów. Bez telefonu.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-krok\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-krok\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-cyfra\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-cyfra\">2</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Propozycja w 48 h</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Jednostronicowa, na piśmie: pakiet, łączna kwota i termin.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-krok\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-krok\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-cyfra\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-cyfra\">3</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Zadatek i materiały</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Zadatek 40% i to, czego potrzebuję od Ciebie: zdjęcie, dane i dostęp do domeny.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-krok\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-krok\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-cyfra\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-cyfra\">4</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Szkic w 5 dni roboczych</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Do akceptacji, z filmem 2–3 minuty i 2 rundami poprawek.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-krok\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-krok\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-cyfra\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-cyfra\">5</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Publikacja i 30 dni wsparcia</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Po płatności końcowej: instrukcja, nagranie i wsparcie przez miesiąc.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-przypis-ciemny\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-przypis-ciemny\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>48 h na propozycję · 2 rundy poprawek · zadatek 40%</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-strzalka\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-strzalka\"><a href=\"/rozmowa/\">Umów 30 minut i zapytaj o szczegóły</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"potrzebuje\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" id=\"potrzebuje\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"40%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:40%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">Twoja część</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Czego <em>potrzebuję</em> od Ciebie</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-liczba\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-liczba\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"mp-ok\"} -->\n<p class=\"mp-ok\">ok.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-liczba mp-liczba-srednia\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-liczba mp-liczba-srednia\">1 h</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"grafit\",\"className\":\"mp-maly-tekst\"} -->\n<p class=\"mp-maly-tekst has-grafit-color has-text-color\">Twojego czasu, łącznie, od ankiety do startu.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"60%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:60%\"><!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"is-style-lista-wiersze\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-lista-wiersze\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Ankieta</strong> <em>5 minut</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Zdjęcie portretowe</strong> <em>telefon wystarczy</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Dane formalne</strong> <em>do stopki i polityki prywatności</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Domena i hosting na Twoje dane</strong> <em>dostęp albo zakup według mojej instrukcji</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Uwagi do szkicu</strong> <em>ok. 20 minut</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"backgroundColor\":\"piasek\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"twoje\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-piasek-background-color has-background\" id=\"twoje\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-naglowek-sekcji\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-naglowek-sekcji\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">Co jest Twoje</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Strona zostaje <em>u Ciebie</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"20px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"280px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-karta\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-karta\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<span class=\"mp-ikona\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/> <path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"/> <path d=\"M2 12h20\"/></svg></span>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Domena, hosting i strona</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Są na Ciebie i płacisz za nie bezpośrednio u dostawcy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-karta\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-karta\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<span class=\"mp-ikona\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"/> <path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"/> <path d=\"M10 9H8\"/> <path d=\"M16 13H8\"/> <path d=\"M16 17H8\"/></svg></span>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Prawa do treści i grafik</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Do tego, co dla Ciebie tworzę, przechodzą na Ciebie po zapłacie, na podstawie umowy na piśmie.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-karta\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-karta\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<span class=\"mp-ikona\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"/> <path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></span>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dostęp bez Twoich haseł</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Dostaję osobne konto na czas pracy, nigdy Twoich haseł.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"anchor\":\"nastepny-krok\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" id=\"nastepny-krok\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px, 8.4vw, 120px)\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-nadtytul\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-nadtytul\">Następny krok</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"backgroundColor\":\"czern\",\"textColor\":\"krem\",\"className\":\"is-style-cta is-style-ciemna\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"20px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-cta is-style-ciemna has-krem-color has-czern-background-color has-text-color has-background\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Zacznij od <em>ankiety</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Krok 1 zajmuje 5 minut, a propozycję dostajesz w 48 godzin. Wypełnienie do niczego nie zobowiązuje.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"ze-strzalka\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button ze-strzalka\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#ankieta\">Wyceń stronę w 5 minut</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/rozmowa/\">Wolisz porozmawiać? Umów 30 minut</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mp-zobacz-tez\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mp-zobacz-tez\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Zobacz też:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-strzalka\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-strzalka\"><a href=\"/oferta/\">Pakiety i ceny</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-strzalka\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-strzalka\"><a href=\"/pytania/\">Pytania o współpracę</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
  "protected": false,
  "block_version": 1
 },
 "excerpt": {
  "raw": "Ankieta w 5 minut, propozycja w 48 h, szkic w 5 dni roboczych, start i 30 dni wsparcia. Twojego czasu potrzebuję ok. 1 h. Strony od 1 200 zł.",
